(SECTION I — INSTRUCTIONS TO TENDERERS) Tj T*
(1. Bidders shall have completed at least one similar work of value not less than 40 % of the) Tj T*
(estimated cost during the last seven years.) Tj T*
(2. The bidder shall upload scanned copies of GST registration, PAN and audited balance sheets.) Tj T*
(3. The successful bidder shall furnish a performance guarantee of 5 % of the contract value) Tj T*
(within 15 days.) Tj T*
(4. The bidder shall submit the EMD in the form of online payment or bank guarantee from a) Tj T*
(scheduled bank.) Tj T*
(5. The Department reserves the right to accept or reject any bid without assigning any reason.) Tj T*
(6. The bidder must be registered with the Department in the appropriate class.) Tj T*
(7. Conditional bids will be summarily rejected.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(COMMERCIAL TERMS AND CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(1. Income tax and GST shall be deducted at source as applicable.) Tj T*
(2. The contractor shall comply with all labour laws and the provisions of the Contract Labour) Tj T*
(Act.) Tj T*
(3. Payment shall be made within 30 days of receipt of bills duly certified by the Engineer-in-) Tj T*
(charge.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
