(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers supply, installation, testing and commissioning of lt electrical) Tj T*
(distribution system complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(\(a\) All equipment shall be suitable for operation at an ambient air temperature of 50 deg C.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The equipment shall be suitable for relative humidity up to 95 %.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Site altitude does not exceed 1000 metres above MSL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(\(a\) Switchboards shall be designed, manufactured and tested in accordance with IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Panels shall be free standing, totally enclosed, made of 2 mm. thick CRCA sheet with powder) Tj T*
(coated finish.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The panel shall be suitable for 415 Volt ± 10 %, 50 HZ, 3 phase 4 wire system.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The horizontal busbar shall be high conductivity aluminium alloy of 1600 Amps rating. Short) Tj T*
(time withstand rating of the switchboard shall be 50 kA for 1 s.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Enclosure protection class for the switchboard shall be IP 54.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Internal separation of functional units shall be Form 4.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Incoming breaker shall be 1600 Amps four pole draw-out ACB as per IS/IEC 60947-2:2003 with) Tj T*
(microprocessor release.) Tj T*
(\(h\) All outgoing MCCBs shall have a rated service breaking capacity of not less than 36 kA.) Tj T*
(\(i\) EACH INCOMER SHALL BE PROVIDED WITH A DIGITAL MULTIFUNCTION METER WITH RS-485 PORT.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated operational voltage: 415 Volt) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
